Z||000000||GoCartGuy||03-09-2001||12:39 AM||||OK, here's my question.  Is the 85 GT automatic gear selector assembly interchangable with any other year?  Had my stereo stolen (obviously not the stock one) and in the process of removing it the criminal trashed my gear selector.  Prompt response would be helpful, as the car is not drivable in its current state.<P>------------------<BR>'85 GT "The GoCart"||||reg||5
